# Environment

Copy to `.env.local` and fill in values. Prefer `npm run setup`.

## Required for durable memory

```bash
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
```

## Model / AI Gateway

On Vercel, OIDC + AI Gateway is preferred. Locally you may use:

```bash
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
# or provider keys via AI Gateway / AI SDK
AGENT_MODEL=openai/gpt-5.6-luna
```

## Telegram (default chat channel)

```bash
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_BOT_USERNAME=
TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_OWNER_USER_ID=
```

## Optional

```bash
AGENT_TENANT_ID=default
MEMORY_SESSION_TTL_DAYS=7
MEMORY_PROVENANCE_TTL_DAYS=30
MEMORY_AUDIT_TTL_DAYS=90
MEMORY_TOMBSTONE_TTL_DAYS=14
GITHUB_TOKEN=
GIT_AUTHOR_NAME=self-modifying-agent
GIT_AUTHOR_EMAIL=agent@localhost
```
